*TTRasterizer: Type42
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90

*% 9 mm tape (band verified on the printer) has its own sizes; for any custom size one side
*% must be the tape width (9 or 36 mm).
*% Page size "Auto" prints a label as long as its content: the filter trims the blank
*% space at both ends (2 mm kept). Fixed sizes and Custom (15 mm - 1000 mm long,
*% 36 mm wide) print the page length exactly.
*% Landscape pages (width = label length, height = 36 mm) and portrait pages (width = 36 mm,
*% height = label length, the usual label-PDF layout) both work: the filter rotates portrait
*% pages. For a custom size, one side must be 36 mm.
*% Label pages are LANDSCAPE: width = label length (feed), height = tape width.
*% The top and bottom 2 mm (28 dots) of the 36 mm tape cannot be printed (band is 454 dots).
*% Only TZe 36 mm is verified on the PT-E850TKW; other tape widths are added once verified.
*OpenUI *PageSize/Label Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Auto
*PageSize Auto/Auto length (up to 400 mm): "<</PageSize[1133.86 102.05]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize L50/50 mm x 36 mm: "<</PageSize[141.73 102.05]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize L75/75 mm x 36 mm: "<</PageSize[212.60 102.05]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize L100/100 mm x 36 mm: "<</PageSize[283.46 102.05]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize L150/150 mm x 36 mm: "<</PageSize[425.20 102.05]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize L200/200 mm x 36 mm: "<</PageSize[566.93 102.05]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize L300/300 mm x 36 mm: "<</PageSize[850.39 102.05]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize P50/36 mm x 50 mm (portrait): "<</PageSize[102.05 141.73]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize P75/36 mm x 75 mm (portrait): "<</PageSize[102.05 212.60]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize P100/36 mm x 100 mm (portrait): "<</PageSize[102.05 283.46]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize P150/36 mm x 150 mm (portrait): "<</PageSize[102.05 425.20]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize P200/36 mm x 200 mm (portrait): "<</PageSize[102.05 566.93]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize AutoP/Auto length, portrait (up to 400 mm): "<</PageSize[102.05 1133.86]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Auto9/Auto length, 9 mm tape (up to 400 mm): "<</PageSize[1133.86 25.51]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize S9L50/50 mm x 9 mm: "<</PageSize[141.73 25.51]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize S9L100/100 mm x 9 mm: "<</PageSize[283.46 25.51]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize S9L200/200 mm x 9 mm: "<</PageSize[566.93 25.51]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

